[{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l001","ordinal":347137,"en":"I fear he has found his chance and struck."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l002","ordinal":347138,"en":"Spreading wrath among the multitude,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l003","ordinal":347139,"en":"You have given us an enemy, one God!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l004","ordinal":347140,"en":"A calamity and affliction to the nation—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l005","ordinal":347141,"en":"You have given us an enemy, one God!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l006","ordinal":347142,"en":"The Ala-Too where you made your home"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l007","ordinal":347143,"en":"Was never conquered by a foe."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l008","ordinal":347144,"en":"While bloodthirsty Manas lived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l009","ordinal":347145,"en":"We were a people dwelling in peace."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l010","ordinal":347146,"en":"On the plain of Jylgynduu,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l011","ordinal":347147,"en":"Along the broad Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l012","ordinal":347148,"en":"We would divide a whole sable skin"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l013","ordinal":347149,"en":"Into two halves"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l014","ordinal":347150,"en":"And wrap them around our leggings."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l015","ordinal":347151,"en":"When bored, we hunted roe deer;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l016","ordinal":347152,"en":"Kumis by day and girls by night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l017","ordinal":347153,"en":"We reveled with thunderous joy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l018","ordinal":347154,"en":"Eating the fat colts of barren mares,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l019","ordinal":347155,"en":"With vodka and feasts in winter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l020","ordinal":347156,"en":"We used to revel with loud cries."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l021","ordinal":347157,"en":"When desire stirred, we stayed up all night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l022","ordinal":347158,"en":"Slaughtering mares and playing ordo,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l023","ordinal":347159,"en":"Hunting in rain and flying our birds."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l024","ordinal":347160,"en":"In whatever way we pleased—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l025","ordinal":347161,"en":"Where are the nights that were like the Night of Power?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l026","ordinal":347162,"en":"Where are the flowers that stood in bloom?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l027","ordinal":347163,"en":"Where are those former days of flowering?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l028","ordinal":347164,"en":"Sarybai was no man, but venom;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l029","ordinal":347165,"en":"He was the true God’s wrath!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l030","ordinal":347166,"en":"Against the sons of these Kyrgyz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l031","ordinal":347167,"en":"He came as a living calamity."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l032","ordinal":347168,"en":"What enmity could your scorched dog"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l033","ordinal":347169,"en":"Possibly bear us?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l034","ordinal":347170,"en":"Lamenting, souls wept;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l035","ordinal":347171,"en":"All the people bowed their heads and wept,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l036","ordinal":347172,"en":"Even children too young to understand wept."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l037","ordinal":347173,"en":"Sarybai upon the battlefield"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l038","ordinal":347174,"en":"Revealed the calamity within him;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l039","ordinal":347175,"en":"Before this foreign infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0694:b003:l040","ordinal":347176,"en":"The people despaired of life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l001","ordinal":347177,"en":"The peoples of the world had been destroyed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l002","ordinal":347178,"en":"My renowned father was a lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l003","ordinal":347179,"en":"Favored by perfect fortune."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l004","ordinal":347180,"en":"As for the offspring born from him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l005","ordinal":347181,"en":"Unable to overcome Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l006","ordinal":347182,"en":"What sort of descendants could they be called?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l007","ordinal":347183,"en":"Our first ancestor was Tügöl Khan;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l008","ordinal":347184,"en":"You made all his line lions."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l009","ordinal":347185,"en":"Yet unable to overcome this accursed one,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l010","ordinal":347186,"en":"Allah Most High, one God,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l011","ordinal":347187,"en":"Why did You make us so deficient?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l012","ordinal":347188,"en":"All my forefathers"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l013","ordinal":347189,"en":"You made lions, one God."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l014","ordinal":347190,"en":"Yet unable to overcome this perishing dog,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l015","ordinal":347191,"en":"Why did You make their descendants"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l016","ordinal":347192,"en":"So deficient, one God?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l017","ordinal":347193,"en":"What inheritance can we attain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l018","ordinal":347194,"en":"If we remain alive without dying?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l019","ordinal":347195,"en":"Let not one of us remain;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l020","ordinal":347196,"en":"Let us all perish in massacre."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l021","ordinal":347197,"en":"Külchoro standing over there"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l022","ordinal":347198,"en":"Was a lion inscribed upon our destiny,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l023","ordinal":347199,"en":"Favored by perfect fortune."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l024","ordinal":347200,"en":"He was a soul of terrible majesty;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l025","ordinal":347201,"en":"Not merely Sarybai, but the whole world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l026","ordinal":347202,"en":"If anger chanced to seize him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l027","ordinal":347203,"en":"He was one who could destroy it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l028","ordinal":347204,"en":"If I am parted from my uncle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l029","ordinal":347205,"en":"What inheritance could I attain?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l030","ordinal":347206,"en":"Let not one lone soul remain;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l031","ordinal":347207,"en":"Let me perish in the massacre."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l032","ordinal":347208,"en":"My uncle, a true falcon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l033","ordinal":347209,"en":"Was forged crimson iron."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l034","ordinal":347210,"en":"Rather than let it be said"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l035","ordinal":347211,"en":"That the infidel son of a monster killed him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l036","ordinal":347212,"en":"Let not one lone soul remain;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l037","ordinal":347213,"en":"Let me perish in the massacre."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l038","ordinal":347214,"en":"If I am parted from my uncle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l039","ordinal":347215,"en":"Will the people not settle along the river?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b002:l040","ordinal":347216,"en":"With all the nation slaughtered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l001","ordinal":347217,"en":"Their whole bodies drained of blood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l002","ordinal":347218,"en":"Seeing this, brave Semetey"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l003","ordinal":347219,"en":"Was seized by terrible fury."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l004","ordinal":347220,"en":"When the boy saw his khanly uncle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l005","ordinal":347221,"en":"He no longer cared"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l006","ordinal":347222,"en":"Whether his poor soul lived;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l007","ordinal":347223,"en":"He cast that precious life aside."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l008","ordinal":347224,"en":"Slung with his long-barreled gun,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l009","ordinal":347225,"en":"He prayed to the Creator,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l010","ordinal":347226,"en":"From within the infidel Er Sarybai’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l011","ordinal":347227,"en":"Unbreakable iron net,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l012","ordinal":347228,"en":"From the dreadful pit he had dug,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l013","ordinal":347229,"en":"Offering this prayer to God:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l014","ordinal":347230,"en":"“All my earliest forefathers were khans;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l015","ordinal":347231,"en":"You created them all as khans."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l016","ordinal":347232,"en":"Before one wrathful infidel’s armies,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l017","ordinal":347233,"en":"Why have You made them bow so low?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l018","ordinal":347234,"en":"You made my father, lion Manas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l019","ordinal":347235,"en":"A hero upheld by the saints."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l020","ordinal":347236,"en":"You fulfilled all he desired."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l021","ordinal":347237,"en":"God who created all,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l022","ordinal":347238,"en":"Before one peerless dog,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l023","ordinal":347239,"en":"Why have You brought such disgrace?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l024","ordinal":347240,"en":"While my mighty father lived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l025","ordinal":347241,"en":"Whenever fury roused him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l026","ordinal":347242,"en":"He brought massacre upon the Chinese."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l027","ordinal":347243,"en":"Of infidels such as this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l028","ordinal":347244,"en":"He scattered all four kinds of livestock"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l029","ordinal":347245,"en":"And trod upon their heads."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l030","ordinal":347246,"en":"He ranged along the waters of Sombuk,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l031","ordinal":347247,"en":"And those who fought him crawled away."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l032","ordinal":347248,"en":"When he charged in wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l033","ordinal":347249,"en":"None who resisted him prospered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l034","ordinal":347250,"en":"When true fury seized him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l035","ordinal":347251,"en":"No adversary remained standing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l036","ordinal":347252,"en":"When he gathered himself and charged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l037","ordinal":347253,"en":"No man could withstand him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l038","ordinal":347254,"en":"When they saw my true father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l039","ordinal":347255,"en":"All the people of Chinmachin wept."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0695:b003:l040","ordinal":347256,"en":"Before my father, let alone Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l001","ordinal":347257,"en":"Then the hero Seytek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l002","ordinal":347258,"en":"His heart straying and troubled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l003","ordinal":347259,"en":"Saw countless disasters and afflictions"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l004","ordinal":347260,"en":"Looming close before his eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l005","ordinal":347261,"en":"Calling upon the Creator for aid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l006","ordinal":347262,"en":"Sparing not his life in the struggle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l007","ordinal":347263,"en":"Ready to die if true death had come,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l008","ordinal":347264,"en":"But if he remained alive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l009","ordinal":347265,"en":"To stand as a shelter"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l010","ordinal":347266,"en":"For his uncle Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l011","ordinal":347267,"en":"He resolved to wage fierce battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l012","ordinal":347268,"en":"And rescue Külchoro, his guardian,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l013","ordinal":347269,"en":"From the infidel’s venomous bullet."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l014","ordinal":347270,"en":"He would deliver him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l015","ordinal":347271,"en":"From the iron-rope net,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l016","ordinal":347272,"en":"From the deep-dug pit,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l017","ordinal":347273,"en":"From the blazing bed of coals,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l018","ordinal":347274,"en":"From the monster’s hands."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l019","ordinal":347275,"en":"“If the moon is veiled in darkness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l020","ordinal":347276,"en":"What will become of the night?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l021","ordinal":347277,"en":"If my valiant uncle Külchoro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l022","ordinal":347278,"en":"Falls into the infidel’s hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l023","ordinal":347279,"en":"What will become of his days?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l024","ordinal":347280,"en":"May I be accursed if I do not act!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l025","ordinal":347281,"en":"Let me be a sheltering ridge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l026","ordinal":347282,"en":"A visible source of strength and courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l027","ordinal":347283,"en":"A support around his waist,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l028","ordinal":347284,"en":"And become his true companion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l029","ordinal":347285,"en":"From the wrathful dog’s hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l030","ordinal":347286,"en":"My valiant uncle Choro"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l031","ordinal":347287,"en":"I shall rescue."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l032","ordinal":347288,"en":"He never watched idly while others fought;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l033","ordinal":347289,"en":"He guarded me like a father,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l034","ordinal":347290,"en":"And cared for me like a mother."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l035","ordinal":347291,"en":"He was a towering black mountain,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l036","ordinal":347292,"en":"A lofty crag of such height"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l037","ordinal":347293,"en":"That no surging host could cross it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l038","ordinal":347294,"en":"Will he break through my crag?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l039","ordinal":347295,"en":"Will he destroy us to the root?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b002:l040","ordinal":347296,"en":"Will he divert the river from its valley?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l001","ordinal":347297,"en":"Will there not be black-veiled widows?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l002","ordinal":347298,"en":"Leaving not a tuft of hair,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l003","ordinal":347299,"en":"Will he truly take us as plunder?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l004","ordinal":347300,"en":"Will he not pour out dreadful wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l005","ordinal":347301,"en":"Driving away those who remain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l006","ordinal":347302,"en":"And breaking their ribs?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l007","ordinal":347303,"en":"You have acted with purpose;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l008","ordinal":347304,"en":"Make this merely an age of trial fallen upon us."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l009","ordinal":347305,"en":"God, if You created him as a living soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l010","ordinal":347306,"en":"He was a lion born of a leopard—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003:l011","ordinal":347307,"en":"God, keep my uncle safe!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0696:b003: